msgid "Walk through the [SKQD](skqd#skqd-getting-started) guide to see [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") and [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") used together to sample circuits built from this package’s gates, and to evaluate a Hamiltonian expectation value through [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\") (itself backed by the same `_linear_operator_` protocol method described here).\n"
msgstr "Parcours le guide [SKQD](skqd#skqd-getting-started) pour voir [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") et [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") utilisés ensemble pour échantillonner des circuits construits à partir des portes de ce paquet, et pour évaluer la valeur moyenne d'un Hamiltonien via [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\") (lui-même reposant sur la même méthode de protocole `_linear_operator_` décrite ici).\n"

